  "synthesis": {
    "description": "Staff or an assistant arrange trips and visits: asking which hotel is nearest the office, booking flights and hotels, and sending the traveller the itinerary or a ticketless airline confirmation. Questions about room details are answered from what the hotel will confirm.",
    "steps": [
      "A traveller or visitor asks about travel or hotel options.",
      "Flights and hotel are booked, through the travel agency where used.",
      "The itinerary or ticketless confirmation is sent to the traveller.",
      "Follow-up questions about the booking are answered."
    ],
    "approach": "A standard visitor travel note listing nearby hotels, the travel agency contact and booking steps, plus a reusable itinerary message, would cover the repeated questions.",
    "rationale": "Rounds are mostly sending the same kinds of information to travellers and visitors, so a reusable message saves the most effort.",
    "artifact_type": "email_template"
  },
